## 2026-06-16 Gabriele Cosmo (geomvol-test-V11-04-01)
- Enabled disactivated assertions in tests and updated test cases.

## 2026-06-12 Gabriele Cosmo (geomvol-test-V11-04-00)
- Added smoke tests for parallel overlap checks.
- Fixed unit tests testExitNormalNav.cc (which was failing for round-off error)
  and testG4Touchables.cc (which was failing for incorrect direction in input).
- Updated build scripts.

## 2023-09-04 Gabriele Cosmo (geomvol-test-V11-01-01)
- Removed references to G4TouchableHistoryHandle, which is now deprecated.

## 2023-08-31 Gabriele Cosmo (geomvol-test-V11-01-00)
- Removed references to obsolete and unused G4GRSSolid and G4GRSVolume types.

## 2022-11-18 John Apostolakis (geomvol-test-V11-00-00)
